  "body": "⭕ When a {Fortune} card you control would be discarded: Shuffle that card into your deck instead. Then, draw 1 card. (Limit once per round.)\n⭐ effect: +1. Search the top 6 cards of your deck for an {Fortune} card and draw it. Shuffle your deck.",
  "flavor": "\"My luck will turn around one day, I know it will.\"",
  "illustrator": "Aleksander Karcz",
  "card_number": "13",
  "encounter_group_number": "",
  "picture_base64": "data:image/jpeg;base64,",
  "image_mode": 1,
  "back": {
    "name": "🏅Wendy Adams",
    "subtitle": "The Urchin",
    "class": "生存者",
    "card_back": {
      "other": "【Deckbuilding Options】: Survivor cards (🏕️) level 0-2, {Fortune} cards level 0-3, Mystic cards (🧘) level 0-2, Neutral cards level 0-5.\n【Deckbuilding Requirements】 (do not count toward deck size): Wendy's Amulet, Abandoned and Alone, 1 random basic weakness.",
      "story": "Mama used to let Wendy play with her necklace when she was small. Mama would tell her stories, and Wendy would spin the necklace and watch as it glittered. Then, word came that her father had been lost at sea, and Mama started acting strange, drawing unusual symbols in chalk all over the house. They took Mama to the asylum, and Wendy went to the orphanage. Before they took her away, Mama gave her the necklace, to \"protect her.\" Wendy stayed in the orphanage for several years before running away, deciding that she could take better care of herself on her own.",
      "size": 30
    },
